OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews tackle large vehicle
OL,4,Afire on M6
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the M6 was closed as fire
OL,7,Fcrews from four stations tackled a
OL,8,Fvehicle fire.
OL,10,FFirefighters from Carlise, Longtown and
OL,11,FWigton in Cumbria and Gretna in
OL,12,FScotland were called to the blaze near
OL,13,FTodhills Services in Cumbria at about
OL,14,F18:00 BST on Friday.
OL,16,FA car transporter carrying nine
OL,17,Fvehicles including an electric vehicle
OL,18,Fand a tractor unit was "well alight",
OL,19,FCumbria Fire and Rescue Service said.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
