OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews tackle large vehicle
OL,4,Afire on M6
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe southbound carriageway was closed
OL,7,Ffor three hours while crews brought the
OL,8,Ffire under control, with the driver of
OL,9,Fthe transporter left "shaken" but
OL,10,Funhurt, the service added.
